  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "📖 dsh-better-display",
      "text": "> DeepSeek Harness 沉浸式阅读视图增强（基于 [aa2246740/dsh-better-display](https://github.com/aa2246740/dsh-better-display) 的增强 Fork）。\n\n执行时展示过程，完成后自动收起繁杂步骤，仅保留清晰的最终回答；原生支持生成式 MCP-App 交互沙箱卡片，并深度适配 [dsh-retrace](https://github.com/daha1216/dsh-retrace) 会话回溯节点展示。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 安装与更新",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装 / 更新",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:daha1216/dsh-better-display\n```\n\n> 安装或更新后请重启 DSH Web 并刷新页面。若环境变量中无全局 `dsh`，前面加上 `npx --yes -p @deepseek-ai/dsh`。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 核心特性",
      "text": "- **执行过程自动折叠**：Agent 执行时正常展示思考与步骤，完成后自动收起中间日志，呈现纯净阅读视图。\n- **深度适配 dsh-retrace**：智能渲染撤回、编辑重发与重新生成提示行，自动过滤中间干扰控件。\n- **MCP-App 交互卡片**：在安全沙箱内渲染 ````mcp-app` 卡片，支持通过卡片交互双向回填 Prompt。\n- **无损原生能力**：保留原版「对话 / 轨迹」视图、输入框及工具审批，支持随时切换。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📄 许可证",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-better-display",
      "text": "[中文](./README.md)\n\n> **Fork of [aa2246740/dsh-better-display](https://github.com/aa2246740/dsh-better-display)** (v0.1.1): reading-view support for dsh-retrace nodes — see CHANGELOG.\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:daha1216/dsh-better-display\n```\n\nYou need official `dsh` (or `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh`) and **pnpm** on PATH. `dsh plugin add` runs pnpm in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web`. This repo commits built `lib/`, so a git install does not need `prepare` or a profile `allowBuilds` entry."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-better-display",
      "text": "Then restart that Host and reload the page. `dsh plugin add` writes the profile. It does not hot-load a running process.\n\nAdds a **阅读** tab to DeepSeek Harness. While a turn runs you see steps, thinking, and progress. After a successful turn those collapse and the final answer stays. Native Chat / Trajectory, the composer, model picker, tools, and approvals stay."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-better-display",
      "text": "A ````mcp-app` fence in the final answer mounts as an interactive card in the reading view, inside `<iframe sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms\">` without `allow-same-origin`. The card can fill the next prompt via JSON-RPC. The skill pack is [`skills/generative-mcpapps/`](skills/generative-mcpapps/).\n\nTargets DeepSeek Harness **0.1.5-rc.2**. Display only. It does not change Agent execution, the SDK, or credentials. Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24`. New sessions default to reading."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-better-display",
